00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.030
<b>The Lion's Engagement</b>

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.030
<b>The Lion's Engagement</b>

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.030
<b>The Lion's Engagement</b>

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.030
<b>An engagement meeting for Leo-sama?</b>

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.070
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.700
<b>You should come watch.</b>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:24.910
<b>It's pretty fun.</b>

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.290
<b>Am I allowed to?</b>

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.960
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:35.590
<b>I'm pretty sure your princess and knights got invitations too.</b>

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.380
<b>Noir and I will be commentators.</b>

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.380
<b>Commentators?</b>

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.090
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.240
<b>This is quite the crowd we have!</b>

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.700
<b>The audience has grown 25% since last year.</b>

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.290
<b>The gift and food stands are getting lots of business.</b>

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.660
<b>Excellent.</b>

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.080
<b>Everybody is doing great.</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.920
<b>I have some concerns about the event itself,</b>

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.380
<b>but it's an excellent stimulus for businesses.</b>

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.380
<b>The time has come, everyone!</b>

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:25.260
<b>Your host today will be I, Franboise Charlie, from Galette National Broadcasting, and...</b>

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.810
<b>I, Jean Casoni.</b>

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.140
<b>Our commentators are...</b>

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.770
<b>Gaul Galette de Rois, first prince of Galette.</b>

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:37.940
<b>Noir, leader of the Royal Guard.</b>

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.280
<b>Let's get started!</b>

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:46.990
<b>Lord Leonmitchelli, the most beautiful and most powerful of Galette...</b>

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.290
<b>There are countless men who are dying to take her hand in marriage!</b>

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:56.790
<b>There is one and only one thing that she has to say to them!</b>

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:01.800
<b>Duel me, and defeat me!</b>

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.430
<b>I, Leonmitchelli, will take on every challenger!</b>

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.680
<b>Fight me if you want to marry me!</b>

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.480
<b>These are the strongest men from nations around the world!</b>

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.820
<b>They all look tough.</b>

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.820
<b>And of course, these men are after...</b>

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.540
<b>The one and only, Lord Leo!</b>

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.930
<b>I am Leonmitchelli Galette de Rois!</b>

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.600
<b>I thank you all for your requests.</b>

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.060
<b>I have received some from older men, younger men...</b>

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.690
<b>Knights, noblemen, royalty, civilians...</b>

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:03.190
<b>Men from all different parts of the world.</b>

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.280
<b>But today, you shall fight for a single purpose:</b>

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.860
<b>To defeat me.</b>

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:15.450
<b>I will take into consideration proposals from every man who defeats me.</b>

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.710
<b>This is an engagement meeting?</b>

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.170
<b>It certainly matches Lord Leo's style.</b>

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.220
<b>I was shocked, too!</b>

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.220
<b>It certainly is a strange way to do it...</b>

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:37.520
<b>But only Leo-sama could turn an engagement meeting into such a huge business opportunity.</b>

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.730
<b>Definitely.</b>

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.770
<b>What's wrong, Vert?</b>

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.230
<b>O-Oh, nothing!</b>

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.910
<b>We have our first contestant!</b>

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.620
<b>This is his second time here!</b>

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.920
<b>It's Sir Raymond, a young knight from the Kingdom of Orange!</b>

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.630
<b>He defeated a whopping 500 enemies in a recent war show!</b>

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.630
<b>Here I come, Lord Leo!</b>

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.140
<b>Bring it on!</b>

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.890
<b>Please take me as a candidate for your husband!</b>

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.480
<b>I appreciate your feelings toward me...</b>

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.140
<b>However...</b>

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.520
<b>Better luck next itme!</b>

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:34.490
<b>Farewell!</b>

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.170
<b>He's down!</b>

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.460
<b>Gone in an instant!</b>

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.340
<b>Sir Raymond didn't stand a chance!</b>

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.840
<b>He definitely put up a good fight.</b>

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.090
<b>He even managed to survive the first attack.</b>

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.180
<b>I see...</b>

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.180
<b>Lord Leo seems impressed by Sir Raymond's courage!</b>

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.690
<b>You're amazing, Leo-sama!</b>

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.310
<b>Seriously!</b>

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.480
<b>Round two!</b>

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:10.360
<b>We have the Minister of Defense of Dragée and master longswordsman!</b>

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.820
<b>His name is Lord Berger!</b>

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:16.450
<b>Allow me to become your husband this year, Your Majesty.</b>

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.950
<b>I thank you for coming again.</b>

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.210
<b>However...</b>

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.710
<b>I will win you over with my sword!</b>

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.340
<b>Begin!</b>

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.800
<b>Dark Sword...</b>

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.590
<b>Torrential Dragon Slash!</b>

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.520
<b>Lord Berger has unleashed his Sign Spell!</b>

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.600
<b>His dragon aura is headed straight for Lord Leo!</b>

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:46.110
<b>I just fought some real dragons myself.</b>

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.860
<b>Your dragons seem as powerful as the Divinegons!</b>

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.490
<b>Lion King...</b>

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.860
<b>Lightning Field!</b>

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:03.000
<b>Thunder Fang Explosion!</b>

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.760
<b>Game, set, match!</b>

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.470
<b>He's gone with one swoop of Lord Leo's sword!</b>

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.430
<b>Lord Berger has been defeated!</b>

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.520
<b>Go, Leo-sama!</b>

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.860
<b>Our next contestant is from the Principality of Chamomile.</b>

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:31.030
<b>He is the invincible, incredible, Lord Dolgh the Great!</b>

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:36.280
<b>They say his huge axe can even take down a castle!</b>

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.490
<b>Let's begin!</b>

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:54.760
<b>Lord Dolgh...</b>

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.180
<b>I see you've become even stronger.</b>

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.970
<b>Thank you, Your Highness!</b>

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.930
<b>However...</b>

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:06.690
<b>not strong enough!</b>

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:21.370
<b>Lord Leo managed to push back Lord Dolgh!</b>

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.620
<b>She's just stupidly strong.</b>

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.830
<b>She's completely unmatched in strength.</b>

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.250
<b>Round four!</b>

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.250
<b>We have General Alfried, from the western nation of Eldonia!</b>

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.590
<b>I will deliver my burning love to your heart, Your Highness.</b>

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.850
<b>General Brad, from Eldonia!</b>

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.270
<b>He has won one thousand battles in his nation's coliseum!</b>

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.350
<b>Please let me take your hand—</b>

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.400
<b>This master of martial arts is the
captain of Lagunia's assault unit!</b>

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.480
<b>Lord Dean!</b>

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:58.490
<b>Miyama-dono, a swordsman from the eastern nation of Hinoura!</b>

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.500
<b>Lord Leo isn't giving them a chance!</b>

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.080
<b>She's rejecting these men left and right!</b>

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.750
<b>We have a message from our VIP seats!</b>

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.210
<b>Hello!</b>

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.510
<b>Howdy!</b>

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.470
<b>You're doing great, Leo-sama!</b>

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:25.510
<b>You'll be single forever if you don't stop getting stronger!</b>

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.140
<b>Enough with the jokes!</b>

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.980
<b>I am thoroughly entertained by these brave men.</b>

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:37.400
<b>I am thrilled to be able to put my all into fighting.</b>

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.610
<b>Thank you all for coming to wed me!</b>

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.950
<b>We're getting to the bottom of the list!</b>

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.540
<b>Our next challenger is...</b>

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.870
<b>Good day, Your Majesty.</b>

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.550
<b>I'm not one to talk,</b>

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.590
<b>but this next man here is quite short.</b>

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.890
<b>Where could he be from?</b>

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:12.270
<b>Our next challenger has requested his name and nationality be undisclosed.</b>

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.400
<b>I beg your forgiveness.</b>

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.940
<b>I said I would take on <i>any</i> challenger.</b>

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:19.740
<b>Give me all you've got.</b>

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.900
<b>I see you have...</b>

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.240
<b>a sword, and...</b>

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.780
<b>a crossbow?</b>

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:26.910
<b>Yes!</b>

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.080
<b>Then I shall fight with a sword and short bow!</b>

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.790
<b>I am flattered!</b>

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.630
<b>Hey, Gaul-sama...</b>

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.420
<b>Is that...</b>

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.800
<b>Yeah, pretty sure.</b>

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:45.050
<b>Let the battle begin!</b>

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.100
<b>Looks like we'll be seeing some arrows fly.</b>

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.810
<b>They slowly ready their arrows...</b>

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.440
<b>Wow!</b>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.570
<b>He's fast!</b>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.440
<b>I couldn't even see what was happening!</b>

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:47.160
<b>Leo-sama put in a hit just as he shot her!</b>

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.200
<b>Exactly.</b>

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.830
<b>That must be why he stopped attacking.</b>

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.200
<b>He seems to be more than your average warrior.</b>

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.460
<b>That's right! He's amazing!</b>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.710
<b><i>I haven't heard any rumors of such a masterful warrior in the neighboring nations...</i></b>

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:07.220
<b><i>If he's hidden his name and face, he must be someone I know.</i></b>

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.220
<b><i>But I have no clue!</i></b>

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.970
<b>Have I met you somewhere before?</b>

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.100
<b>Yes.</b>

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.600
<b>Unfortunately, I cannot recall who you are.</b>

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.110
<b>I will tell you once I win.</b>

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.360
<b>I like that.</b>

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.740
<b>However, I don't like to be bothered by unanswered questions as I fight.</b>

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.620
<b>I'll take that headdress off <i>for</i> you!</b>

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.720
<b>Inferno Tempest Slash!</b>

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.290
<b>Oh my god!</b>

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>As we expected, he's just a little boy!</b>

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.790
<b>He's quite charming!</b>

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.840
<b>Hey, he's got...</b>

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.800
<b>The same ears and tail as Vert, right?</b>

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.300
<b>Is that...</b>

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.680
<b>Yes.</b>

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:36.180
<b>He's Prince Lief Langue de Chat Halver, the eighth prince of Halver, my home country!</b>

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.350
<b>I remember now!</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.560
<b>I <i>have</i> met you before!</b>

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:10.090
<b>I remember teaching you archery and swordfighting.</b>

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.390
<b>You had just begun training back then,</b>

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.970
<b>but I could see how serious you were about it.</b>

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.350
<b>I hadn't seen you since,</b>

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.850
<b>but I certainly do remember you!</b>

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.360
<b>I must apologize, however, for not recognizing you at first.</b>

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.360
<b>You've become much stronger.</b>

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.530
<b>Thank you, Your Majesty.</b>

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.490
<b>But I still have a lot of room for growth!</b>

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.910
<b>Who is he, Prince Gaul, Noir-san?</b>

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.580
<b>He's the eighth prince of Saint-Halver.</b>

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.250
<b>He's a distant relative of Vert.</b>

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.710
<b>Right, Vert-san is from Halver!</b>

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.930
<b>I did hear that he had been doing a lot of practice,</b>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.760
<b>but he's turned out way stronger than I'd imagined.</b>

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.770
<b>It's unbelievable how he's come all the way here to marry Leo-sama.</b>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.310
<b>This brings back so many memories.</b>

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:06.650
<b>What were we doing the last time we met?</b>

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:10.400
<b>You showed me the path that I should take!</b>

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.900
<b>You're a very quick learner.</b>

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:17.660
<b>Be sure to train with your fellow warriors from here on out.</b>

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.910
<b>Yes!</b>

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:23.120
<b>You've got such a charming face already.</b>

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:27.420
<b>If you become a great warrior, the women will be all over you!</b>

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.920
<b>Really?</b>

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.340
<b>What?</b>

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.760
<b>Is there a girl that you like?</b>

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.930
<b>No, I...</b>

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.220
<b>It's nothing to be ashamed of!</b>

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.430
<b>Once you become a mighty warrior,
you should tell her how you feel!</b>

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.810
<b>Will she requite my love?</b>

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.150
<b>Of course!</b>

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:50.770
<b>If you become a strong, kind, wise man,</b>

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:51.940
<b>she would never say no.</b>

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:58.740
<b>Oh, I do remember saying such things!</b>

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.450
<b>But, since you're here now...</b>

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.580
<b>That's such a cute story!</b>

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.250
<b>Prince Lief, you lady killer!</b>

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.840
<b>Right?!</b>

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:14.130
<b>Th-That's why I was hiding my face and name!</b>

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.590
<b>I didn't want you to have these concerns!</b>

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.010
<b>I-I see.</b>

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.470
<b>Thank you for your consideration.</b>

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.850
<b>There are many things I'd like to tell you after I win.</b>

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.270
<b>I would love to hear them,</b>

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.110
<b>but that won't be happening this year...</b>

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.900
<b>because <i>I</i> am going to win!</b>

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:38.110
<b>What's this?!</b>

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:40.620
<b>They're both going straight for the kill!</b>

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.120
<b>Their next move will surely finish the match.</b>

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.130
<b>Dragon Nova Circle!</b>

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.530
<b>I like the way you fight!</b>

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.580
<b>U-Unbelievable!</b>

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:28.790
<b>Their clashing weapons have caused an <i>enormous</i> explosion!</b>

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.550
<b>Who's left standing?</b>

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.310
<b>I-It's...</b>

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.740
<b>Lord Leo just barely takes the cake!</b>

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:10.210
<b>Still, he had taken her right to the verge of defeat!</b>

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.420
<b>I enjoyed fighting with you.</b>

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.960
<b>Do come again.</b>

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.210
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:22.260
<b>I won't be praising your growth.</b>

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.470
<b>I must become stronger to defeat you again next year!</b>

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.060
<b>Then I'll train even harder than you!</b>

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:32.730
<b>Another round of applause for our challenger!</b>

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.120
<b>Wh-Who would've seen this coming?!</b>

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:53.370
<b>Her armor was literally a <i>touch</i> away from shattering!</b>

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.380
<b>So...</b>

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.010
<b>What exactly is this?</b>

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.630
<b>It's an afterparty for the engagement meeting.</b>

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:08.140
<b>They say it's a social event for fine ladies and gentlemen... or something.</b>

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.640
<b>It's an opportunity for nations to break the ice with each other!</b>

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.480
<b>And it's a place where young, foolish romance begins.</b>

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.270
<b>We'll be with our princesses.</b>

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:21.150
<b>I'm not really a fan of these formal events.</b>

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.700
<b>Screw love, I want food!</b>

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.910
<b>Let me come, too!</b>

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.160
<b>Me too!</b>

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.410
<b>Yuki, Rico, wait!</b>

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:32.250
<b>Come with us, Hero-sama!</b>

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.830
<b>Good evening!</b>

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:35.420
<b>Hero-sama!</b>

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:40.050
<b>I've seen you fight on television!</b>

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.670
<b>We were amazed by your fighting, too!</b>

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.260
<b>You were amazing!</b>

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.180
<b>Definitely!</b>

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.180
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:53.100
<b>I'm even more impressed that you came to marry Leo-sama!</b>

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:57.190
<b>It definitely shows how mature you are.</b>

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.730
<b>Marry?</b>

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.270
<b>I didn't really have that in mind.</b>

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:03.820
<b>I just wanted to talk to Leo-sama in person,</b>

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.320
<b>and that's why I participated.</b>

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:10.830
<b>L-Lief, weren't you going to talk to her about marrying her?</b>

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:15.830
<b>An engagement meeting is where you have engaging conversation in private, right?</b>

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.120
<b>No!</b>

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:21.210
<b>An engagement meeting is a thing
you do in preparation for marriage.</b>

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:26.050
<b>N-No, I...</b>

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.970
<b>I can't believe I made that kind of mistake in front of such a huge audience!</b>

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.100
<b>It should be fine, though.</b>

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.720
<b>You <i>do</i> like Leo-sama, after all.</b>

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.980
<b>She seemed happy about that, too!</b>

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.070
<b>Prince!</b>

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.070
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.690
<b>Someone take him to a bed!</b>

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:55.870
<b>That's one more thing to look forward to.</b>

